{{!-- The media block on a person's page. Receives an
      EntityMediaBlock: one button to the gallery of the media carrying the
      page's hashtag. The page shows no items itself; the gallery holds them.
      The caller renders it only when media exists and supplies the heading in
      its own section system. --}}
<p><a href="{{galleryHref}}" class="btn btn-outline">{{buttonLabel}}</a></p>
